---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AAA Playable Games for DroidDeck — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="AAA games that are playable on DroidDeck with lowered settings and FSR. Performance expectations for Android handhelds."
  page="games"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .game-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-size:14px}
    .game-table th,.game-table td{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
    .game-table th{background:#f4f7fa;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
    .game-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
    .fps-mid{font-weight:700;color:#d97706}
    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Game Compatibility</div>
        <h1>AAA Playable List</h1>
        <p>Demanding games that can be played on high-end DroidDeck devices with low settings and FSR. Expect 25–40 FPS, not 60.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="game-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Game</th>
              <th>Performance</th>
              <th>Settings</th>
              <th>Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>The Witcher 3</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">30–40 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Quality</td>
              <td class="note">Best on handhelds with active cooling. Cities drop FPS.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Grand Theft Auto V</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">30–45 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Normal + FSR</td>
              <td class="note">Older DX11 title; runs better than many newer games.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Dark Souls III</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">25–35 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Balanced</td>
              <td class="note">Playable but demanding; keep settings minimal.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">25–35 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Performance</td>
              <td class="note">Fast combat can feel sluggish below 30 FPS.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
